  abilityDesc: 19 combo powerful Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), probable critical vulnerability infliction for 1 turn, hugely boosts Atk,
    Def, Rec for 3 turns, hugely boosts own Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns, enormously
    boosts critical hit rate and BB gauge for 3 turns & slight damage reduction from
    all types for 1 turn
